      Exists if the subject SpatialObject is spatially covered 
      by the object SpatialObject. DE-9IM: TFF*TFT**
    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql"/>
